            "review_title": "Review at Bánh Canh Cua Bà Ba",
            "review_text": "karng\n305 contributions\n0\nGreat Variety of Toppings, Missing Richness\nJun 2026 • Solo\nThe bánh canh cua had chewy noodles with a consistent texture, and I especially enjoyed the variety of textures from the different toppings. Portions were generous overall, although I would have liked more crab meat. The broth was slightly thick but lacked the richness.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 6, 2026",
